// The boss's sweep: 68 ticks, the default sweep (docs/architecture.md
// section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-30, active 30-38, recovery 38-68.
// Each part has keyframes at its ends, so the game can stretch each part
// on its own. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along
// the model's axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// 0: standing. 14: lifting the halberd in both hands. 30: wound up, the
// blade out behind on the right, the body turned right. 31 to 38: one key a
// tick, the halberd swept level from the right round the front to the left
// (the hit is a sector swept right to left), the left foot stepping in.
// 46: following through on the left. 56: coming back. 68: standing.
